    "title": "Ease of OL reshuffle again key factor to Bobcat playoff run - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Thomas Stuber ,\n1 days ago Montana State got off to a rocky start in 2025, losing to a pair of formidable opponents in the FBS No. 7 Oregon Ducks in the season opener, then the FCS No. 2 South Dakota State Jackrabbits. The Ducks are the No. 5 seed in the FBS playoffs and have advanced to the quarterfinals, while SDSU suffered a slew of injuries before making the FCS playoffs on the final day of the regular season, only to fall in the second round at Montana. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
